# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# File      : config/rman_configuration.rman
# Purpose   : Baseline RMAN retention and control-file autobackup settings.
# Usage     : rman target / @config/rman_configuration.rman
# Requires  : RMAN privileges for the target database.
#
# Review the recovery window against your recovery requirements before use.
